# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Beyond the Title — .gitignore
#
# RULE: real employee content (videos, transcripts, captions, thumbnails,
# working JSON) never belongs in this repository. Only source code, docs and
# SYNTHETIC fixtures are committed. These patterns are a safety net — keep
# your real project folder outside the repo (e.g. ~/Documents/...).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Secrets (none are needed by this project — never add any)
.env
.env.*

# Local working folders, test output and release packages
/release/
/workspace/
/project/
/tmp/
/test-output/
*.zip

# Project-folder content accidentally created inside the repo
/data/
/stories/
/backups/
/site/data/
/site/stories/
/site/backups/
**/backups/
!fixtures/**/backups/

# Real media and caption assets (synthetic fixtures may be re-included below)
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
*.webm
*.mkv
*.vtt
*.srt
*.webp
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# Transcripts: plain-text files are ignored everywhere except synthetic fixtures
*.txt
!fixtures/**/*.txt
!fixtures/**/*.vtt

# Node tooling is optional and dev-only; never commit installs
node_modules/
